WEBVTT

00:13:29.930 --> 00:13:33.016
I took him to a doctor
to remove his tattoo.

00:13:33.642 --> 00:13:37.354
And the session started with the laser,
and it's very painful.

00:13:38.438 --> 00:13:43.193
And at the end of it, the doctor removed
the laser and she told him,

00:13:43.235 --> 00:13:46.488
"Well, who's better than a Jewish doctor
to remove your swastika?"

00:13:46.488 --> 00:13:53.161
(Laughter and applause)

00:13:53.203 --> 00:13:54.371
And that's him now.

00:13:54.371 --> 00:14:01.336
(Applause and cheers)